rence and so you know  if you think about partnering with  Google particularly on the tech  partnering side I can tell you for sure  now is the time that you should really  be doing that investigation with us  because it just seems like there's so  many things to be going at here in terms  of really bringing innovation to our  customers and really transforming  industry so you know we are open for  business and we would certainly love to  talk to folks about how to how to do  more tech partnering thank you for your
 

